# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course explores some of the most promising applications of quantum computing, including Hamiltonian simulation, optimization, machine learning, and differential equations. Each application is introduced through its theoretical motivation and then explored through hands-on case studies. We examine how real-world problems are mapped to quantum computers, which quantum techniques they use, and what evidence is needed to assess their potential.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini meneroka beberapa aplikasi pengkomputeran kuantum yang paling menjanjikan, termasuk simulasi Hamiltonian, pengoptimuman, pembelajaran mesin, dan persamaan pembezaan. Setiap aplikasi diperkenalkan melalui motivasi teorinya dan kemudian diterokai melalui kajian kes secara praktikal. Kami meneliti cara masalah dunia sebenar dipetakan kepada komputer kuantum, teknik kuantum yang digunakannya, dan bukti yang diperlukan untuk menilai potensinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
